          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">30 min response</span></div>
          <p>Merseyside is a hard water area. Limescale builds up in heat exchangers. It blocks pipework. It kills mixer showers. We diagnose limescale faults specifically. Where it makes sense, we recommend a water softener or scale reducer.</p>
